{"unit_id":"jadehare__dsh-model-controller#card-zh","repo":"jadehare/dsh-model-controller","commit":"28d2f82b18cbb7ed554c871dc98e6f5d906f03e5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-controller 是面向 DSH Web 的模型路由插件。它在每个用户 turn 中读取请求文本，按已配置的正则规则优先匹配，并可在未命中时通过语义分类选择模型和推理强度；Plan Mode 也能切换到专用模型。它还提供浏览器设置卡片，用于调整匹配模式、路由规则、分类器、Plan Mode 和路由元数据。适合希望按任务类型自动分配模型的 DSH 用户。需要在 DSH 中配置可用的模型提供方；插件未声明额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:245-283","src/client/index.tsx:887-913"]}
{"unit_id":"jadehare__dsh-model-controller#card-en","repo":"jadehare/dsh-model-controller","commit":"28d2f82b18cbb7ed554c871dc98e6f5d906f03e5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-controller routes DSH Web requests to models. It checks regex rules first and can classify unmatched requests semantically. Plan Mode can use a dedicated model. The browser settings card edits routes, matching mode, the classifier, and reasoning metadata. Configure providers in DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:245-283","src/client/index.tsx:887-913"]}
